        "model": "gpt-6"
      },
      "text": "Before travelling to the coast, take a walk along the Místico hanging bridges near Arenal Volcano.\n\nThe nature park has trails through primary tropical forest.\n\nThe route is suitable for a range of fitness levels.\n\nThe trails cover about 2 miles in total.\n\nAllow approximately 2.5 hours for the walk.\n\nAlong the way, you can observe birds, plants and other parts of the tropical ecosystem at different levels of the forest.\n\nThe route crosses 15 bridges in all, six of them suspension bridges.\n\nSome sections take you closer to the treetops, where you can look down over the forest.\n\nThere are also views of Arenal Volcano along the way.\n\nAfter the walk, transfer to Tamarindo Beach."
    },
