        "runId": "ada-en-mw96khaf-1a0l7x",
        "model": "gpt-6"
      },
      "text": "Two free days on the Pacific coast.\n\nStay at Wyndham Tamarindo.\n\nSpend time on the beach and choose any optional activities at your own pace.\n\nBreakfast is included on both days.\n\nAfter several days exploring volcanic and tropical landscapes, this is a quieter part of the trip, with no scheduled daytime activities."
